      "description": "I want to give an alternative option to Data for SEO because we use that at the moment for finding out whether a company is running ads but there's a $50 minimum spend. Instead could we create a scraper to scrape the Google Ads Transparency Centre for each company, just the code to do it, so that on demand we can scrape to see whether a company is running Google Ads? I don't know whether Google will block us so maybe we need to use Oxylabs. Could you tell me whether Oxylabs or some other IP oxy rotation would work?",
